From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:50:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Withhold per-share comparisons that straddle a
 share-basis event

A per-share value is restated for every bonus issue, split or rights
issue effective before its report is filed, so EPS or DPS taken from
reports filed on either side of such an event sit on different bases.
share_basis.audit_share_basis names the current growth, CAGR and QoQ rows
affected without rewriting stored data; completeness no longer counts a
per-share comparison key whose every current row is affected, and the
share-basis-audit command reports them for acceptance review.

